{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43313","headline":"饯王将军赴云中 · 孟匡明","name":"饯王将军赴云中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一师凭庙畧，分阃佐元戎。\n势亚彤弓宠，时推金印雄。\n关山横代北，旌节壮河东。\n日转前茅影，春生细柳风。\n饮冰君命速，挥涕饯筵空。\n伫听阴山静，谁争万里功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟匡明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}